The critical error is on line 39. The `<jackson-bom.version>3.2.3</jackson-bom.version>` tag is incorrectly placed *outside* and *after* the closing `</properties>` tag. This is why Maven
is treating it as an unrecognized tag – it's not within the expected context.

My plan now is to rectify this. I will remove that misplaced tag and ensure it is correctly inserted *inside* the `<properties>` section, specifically just before the closing 
`</properties>` tag. This should resolve the XML structural problem and allow Maven to recognize and use the overridden version.

